{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932780/extras/a60c7923eac1dfbf5aa78de6cdf17c8e.poster.avif?t=1770756479\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932780/extras/a60c7923eac1dfbf5aa78de6cdf17c8e.webm?t=1770756479\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932780/extras/a60c7923eac1dfbf5aa78de6cdf17c8e.mp4?t=1770756479\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cCrime &amp; Anomaly\u201d invites you into Raskolnikov\u2019s dark world. Inspired by Dostoevsky\u2019s <i>Crime and Punishment</i> and set in the grim 1860s Saint Petersburg, your Sanity Meter measures the weight of guilt and mental collapse\u2014every step can turn into a nightmare. Hunt anomalies in decaying flats, face the shadows cast by your crime, and feel the echoes of your deeds.</p>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p>  <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\">  <li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sanity Meter &amp; Survival:</strong> Collect clues to keep your mind intact and battle inner demons.</p></li>  <li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Horror:</strong> Cold blue-grey tones with sudden red accents create a chilling ambiance.</p></li>  <li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anomaly Hunting:</strong> Record paranormal events and blur the line between reality and nightmare.</p></li>  <li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hidden Story:</strong> Experience the tension between Raskolnikov\u2019s inner voice and the usurer\u2019s ghost.</p></li>  </ul>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to dive into fear\u2019s finest detail?  <br><strong>ADD TO WISHLIST</strong></p>  <br>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3932780?t=1770756479","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3932780?t=1770756479","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932780/713a97a948de1fc2159bf981ec351f179101e424/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770756479","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932780/713a97a948de1fc2159bf981ec351f179101e424/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770756479","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932780/extras/a60c7923eac1dfbf5aa78de6cdf17c8e.poster.avif?t=1770756479\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932780/extras/a60c7923eac1dfbf5aa78de6cdf17c8e.webm?t=1770756479\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932780/extras/a60c7923eac1dfbf5aa78de6cdf17c8e.mp4?t=1770756479\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cCrime &amp; Anomaly\u201d invites you into Raskolnikov\u2019s dark world. Inspired by Dostoevsky\u2019s <i>Crime and Punishment</i> and set in the grim 1860s Saint Petersburg, your Sanity Meter measures the weight of guilt and mental collapse\u2014every step can turn into a nightmare. Hunt anomalies in decaying flats, face the shadows cast by your crime, and feel the echoes of your deeds.</p>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p>  <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\">  <li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sanity Meter &amp; Survival:</strong> Collect clues to keep your mind intact and battle inner demons.</p></li>  <li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Horror:</strong> Cold blue-grey tones with sudden red accents create a chilling ambiance.</p></li>  <li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anomaly Hunting:</strong> Record paranormal events and blur the line between reality and nightmare.</p></li>  <li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hidden Story:</strong> Experience the tension between Raskolnikov\u2019s inner voice and the usurer\u2019s ghost.</p></li>  </ul>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to dive into fear\u2019s finest detail?  <br><strong>ADD TO WISHLIST</strong></p>  <br>","developers":["Two Cats Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932780/9e6599c2ddb280e48cea37702bdcfd678a5b4e99/header.jpg?t=1770756479","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3932780/820805940/017bc7d6f0b10ccbbe0c6878e9c312ac140dd0d6/1754645905/dash_av1.mpd?t=1754647443","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3932780/820805940/017bc7d6f0b10ccbbe0c6878e9c312ac140dd0d6/1754645905/dash_h264.mpd?t=1754647443","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3932780/820805940/017bc7d6f0b10ccbbe0c6878e9c312ac140dd0d6/1754645905/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1754647443","id":257180241,"name":"Crime & Anomaly","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257180241/b44464d67408ecbbf67874ae5e3b052141d3df28/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1754647443"}],"name":"Crime & Anomaly: Paranormal Horror"